WEBVTT

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.030
Yuzuyu...

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.490
Kippei, make sure to put some vegetables in her lunch too.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.250
What happened?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.080
I burned it.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:37.990
It looks so gross.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:42.540
What is that anyway?  Food?

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.480
It's a hamburger.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:49.640
The heat is on too high.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.490
Listen, listen, listen!

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:58.950
It's amazing!

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:02.170
I got bigger~

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.650
Yuzuyu-chan, get your clothes on!

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.060
I'm seventeen kilos now!

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.050
Wow!  Seventeen kilos?

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.770
I wish I could say that.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:19.510
I ate lots of carrots yesterday, so I got bigger!

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.610
That's good, but hurry and put your clothes on.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:27.530
Onee-sama, which kilo are you?

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:31.720
Don't say "which kilo"; say "how many kilos".

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.020
Button the button yourself, okay?

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:36.550
Fifteen kilos.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.310
Why did you tell such a lie?!

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.840
Not only that, but by saying fifteen kilos, it sounds like you're being vain.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:48.440
Wow!  I'm bigger!  I win!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.280
See?  She believed it.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:54.770
And could you stop making her call you Onee-sama?

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:59.140
You two are annoying!  Hurry up and go!

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:02.180
That's right, Kippei, hurry up!

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:04.350
You too, Dear.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.810
I'm going...

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.020
Okay, okay...

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.080
I'm going, Onee-sama!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.010
Yuzuyu!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:18.050
My, my... It sure is lively again this morning.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.890
Right, Dear?

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:30.300
Good morning.

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.140
Good morning!

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:32.880
Good morning.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:00.200
Kippei!

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:03.940
Good morning.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:04.820
What is it?

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.310
How's the kid doing?

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:08.750
I'll play with her next time.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:14.450
I have a little brother, but he really pisses me off.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.310
Is that so?

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:19.480
I only have an older brother and sister.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:21.230
Is it hard taking care of a child?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.390
I wonder...

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.710
Hey, do you change diapers and stuff?

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.800
Nope, she's five years old already, so...

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.060
Ah, I found Kippei.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:42.150
Wait a second, I thought Kippei isn't going out with you because he's taking care of his cousin.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.580
But he's with girls...

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:51.960
It's not like he went to the girls himself and he's only talking to them.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:55.230
You're too soft.  It's time for punishment!

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.970
And you should make him compliment your braids.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.540
Want me to give you my little brother's hand-me-downs?

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:06.220
Seriously?

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:09.470
It sure is impressive that you're taking care of her.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.220
I'm going to throw it.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:33.680
Okay!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.380
Throw it!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.010
That was terrible!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.990
Yuzuyu-chan, throw it properly.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.310
I'm so bad at it!

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.090
Come on, Yuzuyu-chan, one more time.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.550
You're so bad that it's not even funny.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.720
We can't get started.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.250
Sorry.

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:23.050
I'll try one more time.

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:25.250
Throw it properly!

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:30.320
I'm going to throw it.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:39.770
Yuzuyu...

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.410
Yuzuyu...

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.560
Excuse me,

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.960
can I help you with something?

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:17.670
O-Oh no, I'm sorry, it's nothing.

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:20.150
E-Excuse me...

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:45.450
I guess I'm a little early.

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:56.240
What are you guys doing all the way out here?

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.920
Katakura-san...

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.090
Kippei-san.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.550
He seems better than us.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.190
Yeah, I think he would be perfect.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.480
What would that be?

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:18.070
There's someone outside who's been peeking into the preschool since this morning.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.290
It's dangerous.

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:22.620
I saw her too, but when I tried talking to her, she ran away.

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:23.610
And?

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:27.030
Katakura-san, can you please go look?

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.220
Do your best, young man!

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:31.840
I don't want to.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:35.090
Don't say that.  Please go ask her to stop.

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:36.510
Please!

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:38.720
H-Hey, wait a minute...

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.320
Go for it!

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:46.520
Do your best!

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.710
Katakura-san!

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:18.520
I don't see a dangerous person.

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:35.800
There isn't anyone.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.080
She fell?

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.370
Here.  Are you okay?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.000
Thank you.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:01.670
I'm such a klutz.

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:18.600
Aunt!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.340
You're Aunt Miyako, aren't you?

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:28.060
I'm Kippei.

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:30.870
Kippei-kun?

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:33.370
No way...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:36.460
It's been so long that I didn't even recognize...

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:39.450
What have you been doing all this time?!

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:40.490
Where were you?

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:50.910
Sorry.

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:56.830
Have you been eating well?

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:17.070
I'm sorry.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:19.620
I was just so surprised.

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:22.540
Me too.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.720
Thank you very much.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:41.400
I'm taking care of Yuzuyu right now.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.190
Doesn't that sound like a joke?

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:48.730
I'm sorry.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.960
Did you come to pick up Yuzuyu?

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:13.660
I came to see how she was doing.

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:15.420
However...

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.580
...I'm glad...

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:22.610
...that she seems to be doing very well.

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:26.300
Why?!  You're not taking her?!

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:40.580
She's just going to keep getting bigger.

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.500
She said she's seventeen kilos now.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.550
Is it okay with you that you're not watching her yourself?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.370
I can't...

00:14:58.920 --> 00:14:59.750
Why not?!

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:02.890
I'm scared!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:18.860
After my husband died, I hit Yuzuyu once.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:22.640
That's it?

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:30.610
Mom and Nee-chan smacked me around when I was growing up and I'm fine!

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:31.920
That's not it.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:35.520
It's not like that.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.750
It's not like that at all!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.680
It's not the child that's bad...

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.170
That's...

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:08.150
I've been gradually saving up some money so that I can take care of Yuzuyu properly.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:19.750
I promise that one day I will come back strong...

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:29.200
So until then, please take care of Yuzuyu for me.

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:33.710
Please don't tell anyone that I was here, especially Yuzuyu.

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:41.570
Yuzuyu will always be waiting for you.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.360
Katakura-san, how did it go?

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:27.430
Did you find that suspicious person?

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.300
No, I didn't find anyone.

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:33.980
Oh, really?

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:37.780
That's strange.  I kept seeing her throughout the day.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:38.880
Right?

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:04.060
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:07.240
You're so close to me.

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:08.940
You're so energetic.

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:13.050
You have mud on your face.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:15.310
From playing ball.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:18.990
Oh yeah!  Can you teach me how to throw a ball sometime?

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:21.260
Sure.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.340
Yay!

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:33.450
Please don't tell anyone that I was here, especially Yuzuyu.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.170
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.880
I'm going to go get my bag!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.500
Yuzuyu, come with me for a second!

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:31.070
What's wrong?

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:13.540
Kippei-onii-chan, aren't we going home?

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.640
I'm still wearing my indoor shoes.

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:34.140
Squeeze!

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:10.510
I promise that someday I will come back.

00:24:19.570 --> 00:24:21.890
What's going on?  You seem really happy.

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:25.280
I made a new friend!

00:24:25.380 --> 00:24:27.570
Really?  What is this person like?

00:24:27.810 --> 00:24:32.240
He's very nice.  He put a bandage on me and he can even make a rainbow!

00:24:32.480 --> 00:24:36.460
And he even said that you're cool!

00:24:37.760 --> 00:24:38.470
Thanks.

00:24:39.190 --> 00:24:40.900
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:41.220 --> 00:24:42.750
Shouta-kun of the Cherry Blossom Group

00:24:43.810 --> 00:24:45.600
You played with water, didn't you, Yuzuyu?!

00:24:45.730 --> 00:24:46.190
Yep!

00:24:46.370 --> 00:24:47.440
~smile smile~
